            <ArticleTitle>Matrix elements for anharmonic potentials: Application to I2 morse oscillator.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>208-212</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/jcc.540070214</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many authors have contributed expressions for obtaining analytical matrix elements for Morse oscillators. In this work, we discuss the advantages of using these expressions. At the same time, we propose a full numerical method to calculate these matrix elements and we compare, for the I2 system, the different results given by Gallas, Vasan, and Cross, and the variational method.</AbstractText>
